exportOption.description:
Controls which entities are registered for export.
export all — register every supported entity (entityList is ignored);
export selected — register only the entities specified in entityList;
disable export — deactivate all data exports for the tenant.

frequency.description:
Export schedule frequency.
daily — exported every day;
weekly — exported every Monday;
monthly — exported on the 1st of each month.
